  "description": "Dive into Bowling Crew — a free and easy-to-install 3D bowling game. Completely secure with zero viruses or malware. Always enjoy the latest version effortlessly.",
  "editor_review": "Introducing Bowling Crew, the premier multiplayer bowling experience! Take on friends and players globally in fast-paced 1v1 matches. With breathtaking graphics and over 15 distinctive alleys, you'll be fully absorbed in the thrilling world of bowling. Triumph in intense PvP matchups, advance your level, and rise through the ranks to secure your spot on the leaderboard. Join in competitive seasons for special rewards. The gameplay is simple to pick up but challenging to perfect, ensuring hours of fun. Team up with millions across the globe and aim to claim the title of 'KING OF BOWLING'! Reach out to support for any inquiries or issues. Get ready to hit your best strikes in Bowling Crew!",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Switch between a variety of unique bowling balls to knock down all ten pins and achieve a strike!",
    "Engage in thrilling PvP battles to earn rewards and boost your level.",
    "Join competitive seasons and vie for exclusive prizes.",
    "Discover stunning alleys featuring diverse themes, eras, and atmospheres.",
    "Challenge friends and gamers from around the world in fast-paced 1v1 matches."
